{"id": "legend", "type": "text", "x": -40, "y": -260, "width": 560, "height": 200, "text": "**Module 031** — Formation of the cornified envelope\n\n141 genes at their nodal-map positions. A single-armed module: every gene is + (green). Edge label + = move together, − = opposite."},
